<title>UK: Wyndeham buys Argent for 8.6 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Wyndeham buys Argent for 8.6 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wyndeham Press Group, a specialist printing and packaging company, said on Tuesday it was buying Argent Colour Ltd for a total consideration of 8.6 million stg.</p>
<p>It said in a statement it would also assume one million stg debt on completion. Wyndeham said the acquisition should enhance earnings.</p>
<p>Argent supplies pre-press services principally for the consumer magazine market.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
